  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Heritage Tourism Management Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Gestin Turstica del Patrimonio Cultural</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos del programa son dos: (i) incrementar las divisas por turismo internacional, para coadyuvar al crecimiento econmico del pas a travs de la diversificacin de exportaciones; y (ii) aumentar la generacin de empleo e ingresos por turismo, contribuyendo as a la reduccin de pobreza.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program has two objectives: (i) increase foreign exchange earnings from international tourism, to promote the country&apos;s economic growth through the diversification of exports; and (ii) increase the creation of jobs and revenue from tourism, contributing to poverty reduction</narrative>
  </description>
